# mixin_datalog/program: a Scott sum of four constructors, in order: the
# cycle over a, b and c, the chain over a, b and c, then the ring and the
# line, whose one field is their size. Read by its position
# (com.yang_bo.gezi.contest.corpora.merges.MixinDatalog, ProgramShape).
λ export
. export
  (λabc_cycle abc_chain ring line. abc_cycle)
  (λabc_cycle abc_chain ring line. abc_chain)
  (λsize abc_cycle abc_chain ring line. ring size) λsize abc_cycle abc_chain ring line. line size
